OL,3,ANew job fresh out of uni? Here's how we
OL,4,Asurvived the first few days
OL,5,
OL,6,FGetting a new job is tough and when
OL,7,Fyou've secured it you want it to go
OL,8,Fwell.
OL,10,FIt can be nerve-wracking, especially if
OL,11,Fit's a role you've wanted for a while.
OL,13,FHere, four recent job starters share
OL,14,Ftheir tips on what helped them have a
OL,15,Fsmooth transition and survive the first
OL,16,Ffew days.
OL,18,FSarisha Ganesan, 22, graduated from
OL,19,FLoughborough University in June and
OL,20,Fstarted in a graduate role in marketing
OL,21,Flast month.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
